---
---

<section id="fitur" class="relative scroll-mt-20 py-16 sm:py-24 lg:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <!-- Apple-Style Seamless Feature Stories (No Boxes, No Borders) -->
    <div class="space-y-20 sm:space-y-28 lg:space-y-36">
      <!-- Story 1: Lanjut Otomatis -->
      <div class="grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
        <div class="flex justify-center lg:col-span-6">
          <img
            src="/images/feature-resume-isolated.jpg"
            alt="Lanjut tilawah otomatis di Mushaf"
            class="h-auto w-full max-w-[320px] sm:max-w-[400px] lg:max-w-[460px] transition-transform duration-700 hover:scale-[1.02]"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col justify-center lg:col-span-6">
          <p class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-normal leading-snug tracking-tight text-slate-700">
            <span class="font-extrabold text-slate-950">Lanjut tilawah seketika.</span>
            Buka aplikasi dan Anda langsung berada di ayat terakhir yang dibaca. Tanpa perlu mengingat nomor halaman atau repot menandai secara manual.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Story 2: Standar Sahih Kemenag RI -->
      <div id="kemenag" class="grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
        <div class="flex flex-col justify-center lg:col-span-6 lg:order-1">
          <p class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-normal leading-snug tracking-tight text-slate-700">
            <span class="font-extrabold text-slate-950">Standar resmi Kemenag RI.</span>
            Khat Rasm Usmani yang presisi dan proporsional, dilengkapi panduan tajwid berwarna yang jernih dan nyaman di mata untuk tilawah tartil.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-center lg:col-span-6 lg:order-2">
          <img
            src="/images/feature-kemenag-isolated.jpg"
            alt="Rasm Usmani Mushaf Standar Kemenag RI"
            class="h-auto w-full max-w-[320px] sm:max-w-[400px] lg:max-w-[460px] transition-transform duration-700 hover:scale-[1.02]"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Story 3: 100% Offline & Nol Iklan -->
      <div class="grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
        <div class="flex justify-center lg:col-span-6">
          <img
            src="/images/feature-offline-isolated.jpg"
            alt="30 Juz offline tanpa kuota dan tanpa iklan"
            class="h-auto w-full max-w-[320px] sm:max-w-[400px] lg:max-w-[460px] transition-transform duration-700 hover:scale-[1.02]"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col justify-center lg:col-span-6">
          <p class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-normal leading-snug tracking-tight text-slate-700">
            <span class="font-extrabold text-slate-950">Seluruh 30 juz di saku Anda.</span>
            Tersimpan penuh di perangkat tanpa butuh kuota internet. Menghadirkan tilawah yang hening dan tenang di mana saja tanpa gangguan iklan.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
